            "review_text": "hamo306\nDoetinchem, The Netherlands421 contributions\n0\nLate. light diner\nMar 2020\nQuick diner, clear menu with pictures and Dong pricing.\nAll US-English translated. At Casher add 10 % : Thue/Tax.\nOpen kitchen ! I see that as a plus-point.\nI had \"Mi Udon Bo Trung Bukkake\", hot noodles, in soup with sliced beef and soft boiled egg. Not bad at all. Drinks and extra / toppings are over overpriced. I paid 97.000 for single bowl late dinner menu, it filled me well. Nearly 4 USD, 3 Euro 75. More Japanese restaurants at the same crossing available, pick-your choice.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 15, 2020",
