            "review_title": "Review at Marugame Udon Tân Định",
            "review_text": "James G\nAarhus, Denmark63 contributions\n0\nFast and easy\nJan 2018 • Friends\nDon’t go here expecting Japanese fine dining. This is definitely what others have called “fast food” and it’s not trying to be anything else.\nThe food is relatively cheap, and it’s good for what it is.\n\nThe restaurant is there for when you want a quick and safe meal. I would recommend the Karei raisu, which is just Japanese curry.\nThe tempura is also good, although a bit cold at times when it isn’t completely fresh.\n\nIt’s great if you’re coming home from work and want a quick meal, and don’t want to spend a fortune.\nRead more\nWritten January 30, 2018",
