            "review_text": "Baolan\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam60 contributions\n0\nOne phrase: the McDonald's of Udon\nJan 2018 • Couples\nIf you're thinking about having a good Udon meal, go to Lê Thanh Tôn instead of wasting your time and money here.\n\nTasteless broth, doubtful ingredients (I had #9 with \"beef\", I can tell you it didn't look nor taste like beef. I got a stomachache afterwards...) and unfriendly staff. \n\nThe title says it all: this is a fast food chain, not a place to have decent food.\nRead more\nWritten January 20, 2018",
