            "review_title": "Review at Marugame Udon Tân Định",
            "review_text": "Hien N\nMelbourne, Australia6 contributions\n0\nFresh udon noodles made from scratch!!!\nMay 2017 • Family\nGreat place to have your udon craving fixed in HCM. We visited here twice while we were in the city, and lucky for us we came before the peak hours so we didn't have to wait in lines. The service was friendly, the menu was easy to navigate with an English version available. The restaurant had a condiment counter which is an addition for the locals (because you know a lot of vietnamese people like to add extra condiments such as chilli, lime etc in their dishes) unlike in Japan.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 15, 2017",
