            "review_title": "Review at Marugame Udon Tân Định",
            "review_text": "MalcolmA02\nScotland, United Kingdom567 contributions\n0\nNot our intended destination but a great alternative.\nDec 2016 • Couples\nAs is often the case when you're looking for somewhere specific only to find it no longer exists or is closed you end up searching for ages for an alternate with ever increasing hunger. After a trip to Japan we found we loved the cuisine from there and happily walked into this little gem for some lovely seafood udon and a few bits of tempura. The udon was delicious and although the tempura wasn't straight out of the oil it was nevertheless delicious. I'd happily eat here again and the staff were very helpful and friendly too and prices reasonable so happy days. Recommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 14, 2016",
